                        <p>I make sustainable websites that consistently get the best page scores on google. Being platform agnostic, means I do equally as well on static sites from scratch as I do on webflow or wordpress.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <button class="accordion-header" aria-expanded="false">
                        UI/UX
                        <span class="accordion-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="accordion-panel">
                        <p>Look. There is nothing more satisfying than a nicely made wireframe. The dream is design that just works™. :-3</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <button class="accordion-header" aria-expanded="false">
                        Consulting
                        <span class="accordion-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    </button>
