                        <p>I love finding holistic solutions to things. Got issues that have you stumped? I'm your guy. I can also show you:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><span class="listspace">The preferred method of getting out of a zoom call.</span></li>
                            <li><span class="listspace">The wonders of modern search engines and AI.</span></li>
                            <li><span class="listspace">Why you should not say chai tea. stop it.</span></li>
                            <li><span class="listspace">The dangers (and joys) of using comic sans.</span></li>
                            <li><span class="listspace">The art of email design</span></li>
                            <li><span class="listspace">List making.</span></li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <button class="accordion-header" aria-expanded="false">
                        Writing
                        <span class="accordion-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="accordion-panel">
                        <p>
                            I (try to) blog (when possible). <br>
                            I (try to) write short stories (when possible) too.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
